^SAMPLE = GSM8798781
!Sample_title = Wild type, cortex
!Sample_geo_accession = GSM8798781
!Sample_status = Public on Nov 08 2025
!Sample_submission_date = Feb 17 2025
!Sample_last_update_date = Nov 08 2025
!Sample_type = SRA
!Sample_channel_count = 1
!Sample_source_name_ch1 = brain,cortex
!Sample_organism_ch1 = Mus musculus
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 10090
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = tissue: brain,cortex
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = genotype: Wild Type
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = age: P35-P40
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = Sex: Male
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = After samples harvested, tissues were washed in ice-cold RPMI1640 and dissociated using Multi-tissue dissociation kit 2(Miltenyi Catalog No.130-110-204) from Miltenyi Biotec as instructions. DNase treatment was optional according to the viscosity of the homogenate. Cell count and viability was estimated using fluorescence Cell Analyzer (Countstar® Rigel S2) with AO/PI reagent after removal erythrocytes (Miltenyi Catalog No.130-094-183) and then debris and dead cells removal was decided to be performed or not (Miltenyi Catalog No.130-109-398/130-090-101). Finally fresh cells were washed twice in the RPMI1640 and then resuspended at 1×106 cells per ml in 1×PBS and 0.04% bovine serum albuminat.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = For single-cell RNA sequencing, the library was constructed following the SeekOne® MM Single Cell 3' Library Preparation Kit protocol. For single-nucleus RNA sequencing, the library preparation adhered to the protocol for the SeekOne® Digital Droplet Single Cell 3' Library Preparation Kit.
!Sample_description = Library name: WT_cortex
!Sample_data_processing = Raw scRNA-seq and snRNA-seq reads were preprocessed using CellRanger and subsequently aligned to the mouse reference genome (GRCm38, UCSC) with gene annotations from GENCODE (mouse v32)
!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: GRCm38
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: OGD_RNAseq.csv
